class Solution { private boolean isVowel(char letter){return letter=='a'||letter=='e'||letter=='i'||letter=='o'||letter=='u';}public int beautifulSubstrings(String s,int k){int answer=0;for(int left=0;left<s.length();left++){int vowels=0,consonants=0;for(int right=left;right<s.length();right++){if(isVowel(s.charAt(right)))vowels++;else consonants++;if(vowels==consonants&&vowels*consonants%k==0)answer++;}}return answer;} }
